-- WoW Forever: loot for the trash of the new Forever dungeons that dropped nothing here (Drowned City, City of Dalaran).
-- Each row is one item at its live drop rate: how often it dropped over how many kills, as Wowhead WoW Forever counts
-- them for that NPC (live realm, 1.60.1). Items seen fewer than 2 times are left out (too few to give a rate), except
-- quest items, which drop only while the quest is held. NPCs that drop nothing on live (Mana Ray, Arcane Manaling,
-- Fragmented Sentry, Mana Wraith, Angry Tome, Mana Phantom, Skeleton, Shrieking Banshee, Mindless Undead, Spectral
-- Citizen/Horse/Cat, Snarlfang, Terrorhowl, Brinescale Priestess, Drowned Spirit, Deathless Sorcerer/Watcher/Guardian,
-- King Op, Izha'Rel) are left empty on purpose.
-- Safe to run again: rows carry the tag "wh1124" in their comment and are replaced by it.
UPDATE `creature_template_difficulty` SET `LootID` = `Entry` WHERE `DifficultyID` = 0 AND `LootID` = 0 AND `Entry` IN (250187,255065,255071,258799,258804,258818,258849,258897,264177,268300,268321,268462);
DELETE FROM `creature_loot_template` WHERE `Entry` IN (250187,255065,255071,258799,258804,258818,258849,258897,264177,268300,268321,268462) AND `Comment` LIKE '%, wh1124)';
